	(descr "TDK DEA202450BT-1294D1-H multilayer (LTCC) band-pass filter, 2.4 GHz WLAN/BT, 2.00x1.25x0.80 mm (EIA 0805), 4 bottom terminals. Land = TDK 'Recommended Land Pattern' (datasheet Ver.1.0 Oct 2017 p.6): end GND lands 0.45x1.00, centre RF lands 0.35x0.35 with 0.30 gap, 0.25 gaps. Pad numbers follow a 1=IN / 4=OUT / 2,3=GND symbol: pad 1 = TDK terminal (1) Input (top), pad 4 = TDK terminal (3) Output (bottom), pad 2 = TDK (2) GND (right end), pad 3 = TDK (4) GND (left end, body mark side). RF enters/leaves across the 1.25 mm width; no external matching. LCSC C1512913. https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/21e478ccbe38ab150c1e4ae8c08eb514.pdf?productCode=C1512913")
